# Cloudflare Static Assets redirects — applied at the asset layer, so they cost
# NOTHING (no Worker invocation) and never touch Workers request limits.
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/redirects/
# Astro copies this file from public/ to the build root (dist/_redirects).
#
# These replace the old flat GitHub Pages URLs (/win11ext.html, …) with the new
# nested collection paths. Each old slug is matched both bare and with the
# legacy `.html` suffix. `_redirects` matches on path only (domain-level/host
# redirects are NOT supported), so the www → apex canonicalization is handled by
# a zone-level Redirect Rule instead of here — see wrangler.jsonc.

